// Cargo Container Part Definitions
// General-purpose cargo containers: store food, resources, and pre-assembled colony buildings by mass.
//
// Capacity uses same grid_area formula as fuel tanks: w^1.5 * h / sqrt(5)
// Cargo density: 1,500 kg per grid_area unit (~2.3x kerolox, dense packed metal equipment)

